{"id":"Cc507a047df61da4904f1","zh":"横风","en":"crosswind","domain":"风作用","definition_zh":"文中作用于运行车辆的侧向风环境或风作用。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":"crosswind 也有连字符和复数形式。横风、脉动风和阵风应分别表达。","scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"Cc507a047df61da4904f1","zh":"横风","en":"crosswind","domain":"风作用","group_id":"Hcb88d94fe912969e6635","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"风作用 · Xu等（2019）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D9f9266b212a2f15b59cf","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"横风"},{"id":"D622fb7c78004df4d8771","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"crosswind"},{"id":"D6c2e23cba48d68eab9c4","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"crosswinds"},{"id":"Ddc6102b0d16476f1cf60","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"cross-wind"}],"sources":{"P011":{"id":"P011","title":"A model for vehicle–track random interactions on effects of crosswinds and track irregularities","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2019","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2018.1469775","journal_citation":"Vehicle system dynamics 57 (3), 444-469","label":"Xu等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-a-model-for-vehicle-track-random-interactions-on-effects-of-crosswinds-and-track-irregularities"},"P111":{"id":"P111","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2018.01.005","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-the-vehicle-track-stochastic-model-considering-joint-effects-of-cross-winds-and-track-random-irregul"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Se0f93754c8539d6ee426","source_id":"P011","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"Moreover, it is found that track irregularities should be properly considered in the safety assessment of the vehicle even in strong crosswinds.","citations":[{"source_id":"P011","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sdb6df0c35c2f96f4b50a","source_id":"P011","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"Numerical studies show that crosswinds have a great influence on the dynamic performance of vehicle–track systems, especially on transverse vibrations.","citations":[{"source_id":"P011","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S17b152a6dfd6656ae6e4","source_id":"P111","page":10,"page_end":10,"language":"en","text":"The computation results show that the cross-winds have significant influence on both the vehicle systems and the track systems.","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":10,"page_end":10}]},{"id":"S97ae94363fb0284b2b40","source_id":"P111","page":10,"page_end":10,"language":"en","text":"The vehicle-track coupled system is regarded as a stochastic nonlinear system when the excitations of cross-winds and track random irregularities are taken into consideration.","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":10,"page_end":10}]},{"id":"S92c3e74dc97d131c86b4","source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"计算结果表明:横风对车辆、轨道系统的动力影响均十分显著。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sca9cf9149921bdfeccfe","source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"视横风和轨道随机不平顺激扰下的车辆-轨道系统为随机非线性系统。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C7673eb7e9c4e49a24874","target_concept_id":"C7673eb7e9c4e49a24874","target_zh":"脉动风","target_en":"fluctuating wind","label":"相关术语","reason":null},{"id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_concept_id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_zh":"轨道随机不平顺","target_en":"track random irregularities","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C65396edfe7cd3dd5211f","target_concept_id":"C65396edfe7cd3dd5211f","target_zh":"横向振动","target_en":"transverse vibrations","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[{"id":"C7673eb7e9c4e49a24874","zh":"脉动风","en":"fluctuating wind","domain":"风作用","group_id":"Hdefa3d28c135f45620bd","abbreviations":[],"definition_zh":"风相对于平均分量的随机波动部分。"}],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P111","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车